 "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc9jfj.jpg"}, {"id": 445088, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc9jfk.jpg"}, {"id": 445089, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc9jfl.jpg"}, {"id": 445085, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc9jfh.jpg"}], "slug": "speedball-arena", "summary": "Speedball Arena is a futuristic sports game developed for both VR and PC players!\n\nWelcome to the Speedball Arena, where you can be the heroic athlete of the futuristic sports on a lightspeed hoverbike.\n\nGet on the hoverbike to maneuver with the left hand and use the hook gun with your right hand to carry the ball to the opponent's goal to score.\n\nSpeedball Arena was inspired by the American ball game, Speedball which is a popular college sports. It brings the fun sports game to the imaginary world of VR with a twist of futuristic touch riding a hoverbike and grabbing a powerful hook gun to accelerate the gameplay with more excitement.\n\nReal time multi-player sports game, Speedball Arena will be a unique and fun experience for all ages to play with real friends online. Based on the fair gameplay sports rule, Speedball Arena could evolve as one of most popular skill-based eSports game in the future!", "themes": [{"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/speedball-arena", "videos": [{"id": 49256, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "pXj1U-ASrSw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pXj1U-ASrSw", "title": "[Official Trailer] Speedball Arena", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pXj1U-ASrSw/hqdefault.jpg"}]}